| **Combine nearby museums** | The **Museumplein** cluster (Rijksmuseum, Van Gogh, Stedelijk) is all within a 5‑minute walk. You can buy a “Museum Pass” that lets you hop between them without queuing. |
| **Family‑friendly day** | Start at **NEMO** (great for kids), then walk to the **Rijksmuseum** (family tours available) and finish with a quick snack at the museum café. |
| **Art‑tech enthusiasts** | Pair the **Stedelijk** with a visit to **Moco** (both are in the Museumplein area) and finish with a coffee at the nearby **De Pijp** district. |
